# Feature Specification: Auto-create git branch and notify assignee on ticket assignment

**Project:** DevTeam Hub
**Type:** Feature
**Priority:** High
**Dev estimate:** 16.0h
**QA estimate:** 4.0h

## Overview

When a ticket is assigned to a developer, automatically create a branch on the Gitea repo (feature/T-{id}-{slug} or bugfix/...) and send the assignee an in-app notification with the exact git fetch + git checkout command they need to run.

